            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Yasser Arafat's Early Life</strong><br>\nYasser Arafat was born in 1929 in Cairo, Egypt, although he always claimed Jerusalem as his birthplace. He grew up in a time when the Middle East was experiencing significant political changes, especially in the land of Palestine, where tensions between Arabs and Jews were rising. Arafat studied at Cairo University, where he became involved in politics and nationalist movements, which laid the foundation for his future leadership in Palestinian causes.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Founding of Fatah</strong><br>\nIn 1959, Arafat co-founded Fatah, a political and militant organization. Fatah's aim was the establishment of a sovereign Palestinian state, and it opposed the Arab governments' approach to the Palestine question. The group launched numerous attacks on Israeli targets, believing armed struggle was the only way to achieve their goals. Arafat's leadership in Fatah quickly made him a prominent figure in the Palestinian resistance.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The PLO Leader</strong><br>\nArafat became the leader of the Palestine Liberation Organization (PLO) in 1969. The PLO was established in 1964 as an umbrella organization for various groups fighting against Israeli occupation. As chairman, Arafat sought international recognition for the PLO as the representative of the Palestinian people and worked towards gaining a political stage to voice Palestinian demands.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
